        "PMC10890335::web::018::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mechanical stress causes shear bands to form in the coating.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the presence of oxygen, shear-band regions oxidize rapidly and locally.",
